WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Blanka places a Blanka-chan doll while Jamie is stunned.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:03.000
The jumping heavy kick starts the stun punish.

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.400
OD Electric Thunder activates the placed doll during the conversion.

4
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.550
Heavy Backstep Rolling Attack continues the doll-assisted juggle.

5
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.750
Raw Drive Rush heavy punch picks up the airborne opponent.

6
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:13.150
OD Backstep Rolling Attack leads into Level 3.

7
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.250
The Level 3 cinematic completes the stun conversion.
